   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LLMs are used where they add the most: 3.6k teacher labels, ~290 theme names, insight text and the analyst.\nEverything else runs on the distilled student (521 items/s on a T4) — only 1.7 % of items ever touch an LLM.",
   "originalText": "LLMs are used where they add the most: 3.6k teacher labels, ~290 theme names, insight text and the analyst.\nEverything else runs on the distilled student (521 items/s on a T4) — only 1.7 % of items ever touch an LLM.",
